%% model: gemini_3_8_flash
%% prompt: 21. Running a public electric-vehicle charger (prompts.md)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Available

    note right of Available: Simplified operational model

    Available --> Connected: cable plugged in
    Available --> Unavailable: maintenance scheduled
    Unavailable --> Available: maintenance completed

    Connected --> Authorizing: user presents credentials
    Connected --> Available: cable unplugged

    state auth_check <<choice>>
    Authorizing --> auth_check: validate credentials
    auth_check --> ActiveSession: [authorized] / start session
    auth_check --> Connected: [unauthorized] / reject

    state ActiveSession {
        [*] --> Charging: power delivery initiated
        Charging --> Suspended: EV or grid request / pause charge
        Suspended --> Charging: resume condition met / resume charge
    }

    ActiveSession --> Finishing: driver stop request
    Finishing --> Available: cable unplugged [billed]
    Finishing --> Connected: session ended [cable remains]

    ActiveSession --> Faulted: hardware or electrical fault detected
    Authorizing --> Faulted: critical comms failure
    Connected --> Faulted: ground fault detected
    Available --> Faulted: self-test failed

    state diag_check <<choice>>
    Faulted --> diag_check: run diagnostics
    diag_check --> Available: [diagnostic passed] / clear fault
    diag_check --> Unavailable: [diagnostic failed] / request technician
